Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:15.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,2500,3000)\pos(640,577.066)}Battles in the North and South
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:20.88,Episode Title,,0,0,0,0,{\fade(255,0,255,300,450,5700,6400)\pos(653.755,442.788)}Episode 73 \N\N\N\N\NA Battle of Wits Around Mount Qi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Chief Commander!\N-I am aware of what has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:51.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(326,479.333)}Sīmǎ Yì\NStyled: Zhòngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.44,0:03:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang's saw through my plan, the fault lies on me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(996,465)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It is to our fortunes that you could break out of the encirclement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise. Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ordered the entire army to withdraw and stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has divine foresight,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,battling him with wits is unwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall shut our doors and refuse battle. \NSee what he can do then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:24.51,Thinking,,0,0,0,,-Old villain Sima! Get out and fight!\N-Hurry up and come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:27.71,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima! Get out and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Come and meet your doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:31.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Come out and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:34.16,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:36.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima! Come out and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:38.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:40.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out and fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima! Come out and fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Old villain Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and face your doom now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:06:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wei, has your insults roused them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:06:00.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(966,464)}Chén Shì
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been yelling all day, \Nour mouths have run dry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but not a single Wei soldier came out of camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General, there is no need to be impatient. There will always be tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Wei Yan, am the great General of Pacifying the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been riding on the battlefield, gaining countless heads, and achieving great success in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:28.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(296,227)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:27.16,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yet today, I am but a raving rabble-rouser.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:29.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Is this the act of a great general?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.27,0:06:32.87,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor has employed the wrong man yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:48.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}After recovering two commanderies, you have shown strength to the ruthless,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:52.00,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and your merits are evident. Now, the realm is in chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:56.77,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and the enemy remains unpunished. You undertook great responsibility for the state,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:07:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}but your self-abasement is not the way to sustain the glory of Our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Today, We restore your position as Chancellor; do not decline!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}My duty is yet unfulfilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and the Son of Heaven wants to restore my position as Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}I truly dare not to accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}Chancellor, no need to be modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}If you are not reinstated, the Emperor would be disappointed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and the hearts of the men would cool. It would be wise to accept it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, how have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel tight in my chest, my breaths are short, and I often feel dizzy and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi refuses battle, but do not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army has come from afar, and it would benefit us to end the battle soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Should it go on for too long, there will be much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you return to Chengdu, please report to His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that I have a plan to lure Sima Yi out and that I implore His Majesty to be at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, Zhuge Liang has withdrawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdrawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdrawn...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not act lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.15,0:10:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army must be retreating due to a lack of supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall pursue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shu had a bountiful harvest last year, and the crops are now ripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon that Zhuge Liang must have plentiful supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be hard to move them here, but they can last for half a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he withdraw so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be setting up this ruse to lure us out, seeing that we refuse to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,First scout out what is happening, and then plan for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Chief Commander, the Shu army has made camp thirty {\i1}li{\i0} from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that? I reckoned that Zhuge Liang would not go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hold the camp. Do not act blindly.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue to monitor the Shu army. \NReport any movements immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.73,0:11:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, the Shu Army has withdrawn by thirty{\i1} li.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep scouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, Zhuge Liang is retreating to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Say that again?\N-Zhuge Liang is retreating to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army has been continuously withdrawing, setting a camp for each thirty li.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is clearly Zhuge Liang's delaying tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, should you continue to stay put, the Shu army will go back to Hanzhong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of Zhuge Liang's stratagems. Do not give chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, you need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a great opportunity, once missed, would be too late to regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is a devious trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was an ambush, our troops would be defeated and lose its drive. We cannot advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, I'd like to lead the army to give chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I am caught in an ambush, I will accept severe punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.77,0:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If General wants to go, then you shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We might as well split into two units, and have one give chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you meet the Shu army, you will fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir.\N-The other will be left to provide backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's an ambush, we can attack from front and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am retreating again and again to lure the Wei army into pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I got a report that Zhang He is really coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army is coming to fight us. You must fight one against ten,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and thwart the Wei army's momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will shoulder this important task?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:11.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(312,499.667)}Wáng Píng\NStyled: Zǐjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang, what a brave general you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if the Wei army comes in two different forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you may be wise and brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you can only defend one side. How can you be in both places?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be a general accompanying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, Zhang Bao is gravely injured, he cannot share my burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I am willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He is an elite general of Wei. \NHe has valor of ten thousand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you might be no match for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.35,0:15:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fail, I will offer my head to the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. If you dare to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you and General Wang can lead ten thousand troops each to set up an ambush in the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Wei army catches up, \Nlet them pass for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the troops in an ambush to attack from their rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sima Yi comes later,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you and General Wang will split up into two groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You will lead a force to block \Nthe rear ranks of the Wei army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang will lead a force to intercept the vanguard of the Wei army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Both armies must fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-I will have a plan to help.\N -Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Jiang Wei, Liao Hua.\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will lead three thousand troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and lay down on the front mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see Wei soldiers surrounding Wang Ping and Zhang Yi,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:54.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(305,272)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.67,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,do not hurry to their rescue, \Nno matter how urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(298,503)}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply open this brocade sack. \NIt will contain the plan to defeat the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,, Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wu Ban, Wu Yi, Ma Zhong, Zhang Yi.\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.19,0:16:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Wei arrive, their morale will be high!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not engage them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Only mount hit-and-run skirmishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch for when Guan Xing leads his troops to into the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, turn back to the army for an attack. \NI will have soldiers to meet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Xing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You lead five thousand elites to ambush in the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch for the red flags on the hill swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then lead the troops out, and the enemy army will be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,General, what are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Grinding my blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a great general, but I'm sitting idle in the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A hero left unused. General, you are truly a talent wasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:58.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985,486.667)}Chén Shì
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, give chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Xing is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.99,0:19:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we're here, when will we fight to the death, if not right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, we'll divide our forces into two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Each block a side and fight Wei army to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave your life here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor has a marvelous plan:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly lead the men to attack Sima's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A great strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, the Shu army is mounting a sneak attack on our camp from two directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat back to camp immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have repeatedly warned you:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When fighting against Zhuge, do not contend on the wins and losses of one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.17,0:22:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But you all-!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing of no art of war, acting only on hot-blooded will,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you charged right into battle and met this defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.63,0:22:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,After this, any such action is punishable by death!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.12,0:22:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}Chancellor, your strategy was truly brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}I am merely following the footsteps of ancients.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.91,0:22:47.20,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Battle of Chengpu (城濮之战): A major battle during the Spring and Autumn Period between states of Jin and Chu, the two major powers at the time, occurring in 632 BCE.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.89,0:22:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}During the Jin-Chu Battle of Chengpu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}the Jin retreated for three days' march, arrogating pride in the enemy, and thus won.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}I simply borrowed from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}Chancellor, you are too modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.12,0:22:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Jin was weak, and Chu was strong, \Nhence they retreated ninety {\i1}li{\i0} to arrogate pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}Today, our army won two engagements,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}but you retreated by one camp every ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:23:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}This is quite different from the ancients!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is astute and circumspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.20,0:23:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do not pretend a slow retreat to Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.94,0:23:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,how would he come after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.09,0:23:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, your generalship is multitudinous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.79,0:23:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have learned much from this and benefited much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyue, you are too modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.39,0:23:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you've been working hard all day, please take a rest at the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Boyue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to discuss how to advance next with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.99,0:23:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang Bao...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang Bao... At Chengdu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-What about him?\N-He has succumbed to his injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.06,0:23:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He has passed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.15,0:23:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.45,0:23:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel faint, and I cannot attend to the campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.03,0:24:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only return to Hanzhong to recuperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,After I recover, I will attack the Central Plains again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.08,0:24:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The army must withdraw slowly. You must not let the enemy know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.79,0:24:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi will come and give chase if he knows that I am ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.93,0:24:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the case, then our army is doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, don't worry, it is better to take care of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.99,0:25:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, our army's successive victories have been hard won.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.73,0:25:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How can it be gained and lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.63,0:25:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please go back to Hanzhong to recuperate. Other arrangements can be made here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.97,0:25:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.01,0:25:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Chancellor, our army is on our third expedition, and has been fighting for two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.57,0:25:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}marching through perilous paths and tall mountains for thousands of steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}experienced many hardships and sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.84,0:25:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}all to take Chang'an, then Luoyang, and finally unite the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.08,0:25:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Though the Chancellor's health is now at stake,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.98,0:25:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}we should not abandon our efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.34,0:26:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I am lacking in ability, yet was made \Nthe Administrator of Hanzhong ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.94,0:26:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}When the former Majesty was crowned, I was promoted to "General-Who-Guards-the-North."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.68,0:26:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}To conquer the north has been my wish for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.52,0:26:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}How can it all end \Njust for the sake of one man?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.38,0:26:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang, you-!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.47,0:26:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I would like troops to stay behind and guard Mount Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.54,0:26:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to find a way northward.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.77,0:26:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you can wait in Hanzhong for my good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.49,0:26:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang, this is a military matter of great import. Let me think over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.06,0:26:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.70,0:27:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.33,0:27:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.00,0:27:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw the entire army back to Hanzhong tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.54,0:27:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.61,0:27:50.15,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the summer of the 7th year of Shu-Han's Jianxing Era (229 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.35,0:27:52.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,the Shu army withdrew back to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.15,0:27:57.41,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The third expedition against Wei ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.16,0:28:06.23,Thinking,,0,0,0,,One year later, Cao Zhen recovered and requested to invade the Western Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.33,0:28:09.47,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Rui, the Lord of Wei, named Cao Zhen as Chief Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.57,0:28:11.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and Sima Yi as Deputy Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:16.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,They lead four hundred thousand troops out of Chang'an, pushing into Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.35,0:28:21.17,Thinking,,0,0,0,,At this point, Zhuge Liang had recovered from his illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.18,0:28:27.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Hearing this news, he set out a plan to repel \Nthe enemy, and strike out of Mount Qi once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.26,0:28:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.49,0:28:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army is four hundred thousand strong, carrying much momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How come we are only granted a thousand men \Nto guard the old path of Chencang?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.70,0:28:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we fend off the soldiers of Wei?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Quantity does not matter. \NA thousand will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.71,0:28:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, if you wish for our deaths, \Nplease do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand men against \Nthe four hundred thousand of Wei...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We truly dare not to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.59,0:29:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I let you take one thousand troops for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.53,0:29:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was observing the sky last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.16,0:29:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This month, there will be continuous rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.63,0:29:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Wei has four hundred thousand,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.78,0:29:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,would they brave the rain to march deep into perilous mountain lands?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need for greater arms, you may advance at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.42,0:29:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead the army in Hanzhong to settle down for one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.06,0:29:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Wei army retreats, we will attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.14,0:29:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With a hundred thousand lying in wait, we can defeat those four hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.60,0:29:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.24,0:29:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.51,0:30:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Relay orders to all passes, \Nprepare dry wood, forage, and fine grain,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.35,0:30:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,enough for one month's use in case of fall rains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.45,0:30:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.33,0:30:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, it is now the fall rain season,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.17,0:30:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and flash floods are very common.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.88,0:31:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It is better to stay back until the storm passes before continuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.95,0:31:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already sent a memorial to the Emperor. I can only wait for the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.71,0:31:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang sent me to report to Chancellor, \Nthe Wei army has begun to pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.01,0:31:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army has retreated due to rain, as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.99,0:31:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, if we pursue, \Nthe enemy will be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.52,0:31:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pass my order to General Wang Ping:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.40,0:31:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let the Wei army go. No need for pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.63,0:31:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.53,0:32:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the Wei army is withdrawing in rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.24,0:32:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the perfect chance for our army to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.74,0:32:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why not send troops to pursue?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is good at using his soldiers, \Nhe must have set up ambushes on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.48,0:32:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If we pursue, we will be ambushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.99,0:32:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, how should our troops act?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.59,0:32:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well let the Wei retreat in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.53,0:32:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I, however, will split up the army,\N and move from Xie Valley to take Mount Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.96,0:32:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving the Wei defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.00,0:32:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, there is more than one way to attack Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.07,0:32:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you only take Mount Qi?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.12,0:32:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,650)}Mount Qi is the gateway to Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Anyone approaching the Longxi commanderies will pass through this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.50,0:32:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Mount Qi faces the Wei River in the front as well, \Nand Xie Valley lies behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.76,0:32:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}With the space to maneuver in, we can lay ambushes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.31,0:32:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}This is a stage for waging wars, so taking it first will give us the advantage of terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.69,0:33:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Officers!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.53,0:33:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The troops will march in two detachments.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.49,0:33:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan and Chen Shi will march from Ji Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.33,0:33:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Dai and Wang Ping will march from Xie Valley. \NRendezvous at Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.30,0:33:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will lead my own army.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.88,0:33:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guan Xing and Liao Hua will be the vanguard. We shall march immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.01,0:33:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.76,0:33:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda, what are your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.40,0:33:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky is clear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.27,0:33:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't Zhuge Liang \Nsent out his troops to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.31,0:33:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.61,0:33:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true what they say about Zhongda being suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.76,0:34:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang must have expected an ambush from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.92,0:34:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why no troops were sent to give chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.89,0:34:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's waiting for our army to leave, and then conquer Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.80,0:34:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After successive fall rain, the Shu army must have suffered from its pain too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.44,0:34:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How can they send out any forces right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.31,0:34:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How Zhuge Liang uses his soldiers is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, you must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.75,0:34:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he will split his force into two:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.22,0:34:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One out of Ji Valley, one out of Xie Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.22,0:34:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Day after day, no soldiers of Shu had been seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda, why do you believe that the Shu are moving out?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.97,0:34:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, if you do not believe me, how about I place a bet with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.50,0:34:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,660)}You and I each cover one exit, for ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.91,0:35:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,660)}After ten days, if no soldiers of Shu come,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.37,0:35:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I shall brush my face with rouge, dress in woman's clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.78,0:35:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,660)}and come to your camp to ask for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.65,0:35:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. In ten days, if any Shu troops come,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give the jade belt gifted by the Son of Heaven, and an imperial horse to you, Zhongda.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.40,0:35:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is this true?\N-It is no jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.64,0:35:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That is settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.62,0:35:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will guard the exit of Ji Valley.\NCommander, please guard the exit of Xie Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you take care of yourself along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.18,0:35:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.02,0:35:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders, advance to Ji Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.77,0:35:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.29,0:35:45.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Advance to Ji Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.96,0:35:47.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Advance to Ji Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.53,0:35:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance to Xie Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.27,0:35:56.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Advance to Xie Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.40,0:35:59.20,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Advance to Xie Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.28,0:36:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.05,0:36:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.99,0:36:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, Chancellor's orders:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When exiting Ji Valley, be careful of Wei ambushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.38,0:36:25.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(928.667,480)}Dèng Zhī\NStyled: Bómiáo
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.80,0:36:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Move carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.27,0:36:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you have come here just for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.67,0:36:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's use of force is overly cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.57,0:36:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei soldiers have been hit by heavy rains, their armor ruined by water.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.45,0:36:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be set on speeding home. How can there be an ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.77,0:36:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by rushing in can we win!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.98,0:36:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he making us slow down?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.65,0:36:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's plans always succeed, and his schemes always work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.42,0:36:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.42,0:36:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise men think ten thousand times and ought to miss once.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.26,0:36:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,From the defeat at Jieting,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.69,0:36:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we can see that even the Chancellor can miscalculate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.20,0:37:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Had the Chancellor listened to me and advanced through the Ziwu Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.80,0:37:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,not just Chang'an, but even Luoyang would've been ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He insists on advancing onto Mount Qi.\NWhat's the benefit of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.71,0:37:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He ordered us to advance, yet now wants us to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.58,0:37:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders clear as mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.42,0:37:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.15,0:37:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.66,0:37:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the Chancellor repeatedly instructed:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.66,0:37:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is devious, he is not to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.23,0:37:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi this and Sima Yi that!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.20,0:37:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is our defeat so certain just for Sima Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.50,0:37:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take five thousand troops and head out of Ji Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.09,0:37:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make camp at Mount Qi. Let us see \Nthe embarrassment on Chancellor's face!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.74,0:37:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,General Chen!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.51,0:37:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.83,0:38:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan's actions are no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.84,0:38:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a history of being \Ninsubordinate and dissenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.88,0:38:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I employ him because of his valor and ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.31,0:38:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the long term, there will be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.02,0:38:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Chen Shi took five thousand soldiers and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.42,0:38:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.50,0:38:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Disaster looms.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:41.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(466,654)}Ji Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.25,0:38:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.82,0:38:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:39:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang, come save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.29,0:39:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.23,0:39:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There really was an ambush in Ji Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.50,0:39:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Xie Valley must be taken with wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.21,0:39:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Guan Xing, Liao Hua.\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.04,0:39:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will lead the troops to Xie Valley tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.45,0:39:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.75,0:39:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.46,0:39:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.70,0:39:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Zhongda is overconfident!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.24,0:39:51.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.667,417.333)}Qíng Liáng
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.94,0:39:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been guarding for seven days \Nand haven't seen a single soldier of Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.61,0:39:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how he feels after the ten days are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.25,0:40:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, he will lose for certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.78,0:40:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The men are defending these woods all day and night. It's been quite hard, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them return to the camp to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.77,0:40:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.11,0:40:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, there's a patrol of Shu in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.56,0:40:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-How far is it from here?\N-Twenty or thirty {\i1}li.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.71,0:40:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that Zhuge Liang is really coming to Xie Valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.31,0:40:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, I'll lead five thousand troops to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.82,0:40:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, be careful. Find out where the Shu army is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.02,0:40:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.14,0:41:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.71,0:41:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.15,0:41:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them go! After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.15,0:41:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor's orders; \Nlet them through and capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.17,0:41:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.07,0:41:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Sima has sent me to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.27,0:41:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army attacked Ji Valley, but they have been repelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.63,0:41:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Sima expects that the Shu will also sneak into Xie Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.86,0:41:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so he requests that the Chief Commander not dwell on the bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and prepare to defend against the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.82,0:41:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You go back and tell Commander Sima,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.92,0:41:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,there have been no attacks from Shu here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.42,0:41:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In three more days...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.53,0:41:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if your Commander loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.73,0:42:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no need for him to wear his face in rouge and dress as a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.40,0:42:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.17,0:42:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, hasn't there been Shu activity in the valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.54,0:42:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mere light scouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.24,0:42:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They have been repelled by General Qin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.18,0:42:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.45,0:42:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, General Qin has returned victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.22,0:42:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.56,0:42:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}General Qin is returning to camp victorious! Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.30,0:42:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.84,0:42:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.32,0:42:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.19,0:42:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, get on the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.00,0:43:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pursue them!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.05,0:43:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, do not be alarmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.58,0:43:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongda, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.00,0:43:36.29,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(346.8,526.8)}Xie Valley
Comment: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:44.56,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Retreated three days' march: Now a Chinese idiom (退避三舍)

